      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{q}\\,p & =|\\,p\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({45}^{∘}) \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
